/**
 * Renders nothing: the site ships light-only.
 *
 * The GitBook site this replaces is light-only — its <html> carries a hard-coded
 * `light` class, there is no switcher and no theme key in localStorage — so a theme
 * control would be a feature the docs have never had, arriving on cutover day.
 *
 * Starlight renders this component in both Header and MobileMenuFooter, so blanking
 * it here covers the mobile menu as well as the header. `ThemeProvider` pins the
 * theme itself; the dark tokens stay in custom.css so this is reversible.
 */
